{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MdeALV8QvXK5BQugv1zpwV","type":"tool_result","content":"165\t## Goal\n166\t\n167\t$goal\n168\t\n169\t## Acceptance\n170\t\n171\t- [ ] Target behavior satisfies the stated goal.\n172\t- [ ] Blocking findings include a failing test, breaking input, or cited acceptance violation.\n173\t- [ ] Project feedback loops pass after fixes.\n174\t\n175\t## In Scope\n176\t\n177\t- $target\n178\t\n179\t## Out of Scope\n180\t\n181\t- Add non-goals here before running reviewers.\n182\t\n183\t## Severity\n184\t\n185\tBlocking findings must be falsifiable and reproducible against the current target.\n186\tSubjective or unreproducible findings are non-blocking notes.\n187\t\n188\t## Context\n189\t\n190\t- Add intentional decisions and false-positive preemptions here before running reviewers.\n191\tEOF\n192\t}\n193\t\n194\talmanac_harden_approve_rubric() {\n195\t  local root=\"$1\"\n196\t  local target=\"$2\"\n197\t  local path approved_at tmp\n198\t\n199\t  path=\"$(almanac_harden_rubric_path \"$root\" \"$target\")\"\n200\t\n201\t  if [ ! -f \"$path\" ]; then\n202\t    return 2\n203\t  fi\n204\t\n205\t  if grep -Eq '^Status: approved$' \"$path\"; then\n206\t    return 3\n207\t  fi\n208\t\n209\t  approved_at=\"$(date -u '+%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ')\"\n210\t  tmp=\"$(mktemp \"${path}.XXXXXX\")\"\n211\t\n212\t  if grep -Eq '^Status: draft$' \"$path\"; then\n213\t    awk -v approved_at=\"$approved_at\" '\n214\t      /^Status: draft$/ && !replaced {"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WYQyxcojgyBHfYkApZpoqk","session_id":"14593634-940e-4f64-9481-34cf5bee965a","uuid":"e14ee5ec-ca55-4100-bcac-4d33aba90480","timestamp":"2026-05-26T13:47:33.924Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Find architectural friction in almanac"}
